{"data": {"event": {"id": "8cda9db4-0743-477d-a1ae-e63d7bc0b390", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Comment assurer l'acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques des personnes en situation de handicap", "start": "2026-10-09T15:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T16:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p>Appr\u00e9hender les enjeux du handicap en France \u00e0 travers son \u00e9pid\u00e9miologie, la diversit\u00e9s des situations de handicap et leur impact sur l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques.<br>", "R\u00e9p\u00e9rer les m\u00e9canismes qui entravent l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques des personnes en situation de handicap.<br>", "Comprendre comment l\u2019Anthropologie \u00e9claire la construction sociale du handicap et de la maladie ainsi que l\u2019influence des repr\u00e9sentations du corps sur les pratiques de soin.<br>", "Reconnaitre le concept de validocentrisme et comprendre son impact sur l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques.<br>", "Identifier les leviers pour am\u00e9liorer l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques des personnes en situation de handicap.</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "0ecba29e-2095-479e-9844-2efba6c6c5e3", "name": "Agora JFR -  Niv 3", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "b6cf8e9c-402e-4070-8637-4bc7ef4ae7f3", "title": "Comment assurer l'acc\u00e8s aux soins radiologiques des personnes en situation de handicap", "start": "2026-10-09T15:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T16:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "8a1f8970-2442-48cb-a0c1-428dc6f74fa1", "lastName": "Meyblum", "firstName": "Evelyne", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=234949&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Cr\u00e9teil"}}, {"id": "20298d4f-82ca-4b4b-a7